{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00509","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀雨师乐章 迎俎酌献 · 包佶","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀雨师乐章 迎俎酌献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阳开幽蛰，躬奉郁鬯。\n礼备节应，震来灵降。\n动植求声，飞沈允望。\n时康气茂，惟神之贶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}